@startuml UML状态图_更正申请
' 更正/作废申请状态机（初稿）
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam ArrowColor #64748B
skinparam ArrowFontColor #475569
skinparam stateBorderColor #94A3B8
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #FFFBEB
skinparam stateFontColor #0F172A
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #F0FDFA
skinparam noteBorderColor #99F6E4
skinparam noteFontColor #115E59

state "待处理" as Pending
state "已通过" as Approved
state "已驳回" as Rejected
state "已撤回" as Withdrawn

[*] --> Pending : 提交申请\n[同一记录最多一项待处理]
Pending --> Approved : 合格审核员通过\n[处理人 ≠ 申请人、≠ 版本录入人；依据版本匹配]
Pending --> Rejected : 驳回\n[填写原因]
Pending --> Withdrawn : 申请人撤回
Approved --> [*]
Rejected --> [*] : 原记录不变；重提另建 attempt
Withdrawn --> [*] : 原记录不变；重提另建 attempt

note right of Pending
  处理前原记录继续有效；
  不做预扣、不改统计/预算/余额。
end note
note bottom of Approved
  更正：生成新版本，旧版本 superseded，只计一次；
  作废：原记录退出计算，保留历史与还款关联。
  驳回/撤回后重提 = 新建 attempt（attempt_no+1），
  旧实例终结；同一收支最多一个 PENDING。
end note
@enduml
